# To Catch a Falling Star (windurst 53), completion parity: 199's finish is the Lua's raw player:completeQuest (after
# the trade; then the fame, the shield, the prog), so a GM's Quest[2][53]Prog survives the completion (quest:cleanup,
# which a called Quest.Complete() runs, would clear it). Accepted (GM) with the Starfall Tear beside Sigismund.
char zone=PortWindurst pos=-109.04,-9.0,80.56 job=WAR lvl=75
item StarfallTear
login
quest Windurst.ToCatchAFallingStar accepted
charvar Quest[2][53]Prog 1              # a GM: the quest's own var (the raw completeQuest keeps it)
trade Sigismund StarfallTear x1         # accepted, the tear alone: 199
finish                                  # the tear taken; completed; fame 20; the Fish Scale Shield; prog 2; Prog kept
